      "message": "I think the PD function of the hub might still be affected if the battery goes below 30%.\n\nI think the real problem might be that power negotiation has a higher priority than VDM negotiation. When power negotiation interrupts a DP VDM negotiation, the DP alternate mode negotiation is terminated. Normally, a hub should redo the VDM negotiation process (if it\u0027s a good hub), but some hubs might not be following the spec correctly.\n\nThis guess needs more evidence.",
